cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code, please cite it using the metadata below. Without this
  file both GitHub and Zenodo infer authorship from the account that owns the
  repository, which would drop the second author from the archived record.
type: software
title: >-
  ksim: simulation code for reachable measurement precision and the cost of a
  mismatched null in n-of-1 biomarker trials
abstract: >-
  A single generative model, protocol runner and validation suite for an
  in-silico two-stage n-of-1 crossover design in chronic kidney disease, with
  serum indoxyl sulfate as the case biomarker. One command regenerates every
  number in the accompanying manuscript and its supplement, with Python
  warnings promoted to errors. This is a research simulation framework and a
  candidate trial design, not a clinical decision tool.
authors:
